###Pure
Class demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::In  { v: String[1]; }
Class demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Out { a: String[*]; }

function demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::suffixed(t: String[1]): String[*]
{
  ['a', 'b']->map(t | $t + '-x')
}

###Mapping
Mapping demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::M
(
  *demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Out: Pure { ~src demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::In  a: demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::suffixed($src.v) }
)

###Runtime
Runtime demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Rt
{
  mappings: [ demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::M ];
  connections: [ ModelStore: [ c1: #{ JsonModelConnection { class: demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::In; url: 'data:application/json,${inJson}'; } }# ] ];
}

###Service
Service demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Svc
{
  pattern: '/m2mLambdaShadow'; owners: [ 'test' ]; documentation: 'M2M calls a function whose lambda parameter has the same name as the function parameter';
  autoActivateUpdates: true;
  execution: Single
  {
    query: {inJson: String[1] | demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Out.all()->graphFetch(#{demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Out{a}}#)->serialize(#{demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Out{a}}#, ^meta::pure::graphFetch::execution::AlloySerializationConfig(typeKeyName='@type', includeType=false, removePropertiesWithNullValues=true, removePropertiesWithEmptySets=true))->from(demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::M, demo::m2m::lambdaShadow::Rt)};
  }
  testSuites:
  [
    s1:
    {
      data: []
      tests:
      [
        lambdaParameterIsRenamed:
        {
          serializationFormat: PURE;
          parameters: [ inJson = '{"v":"x"}' ]
          asserts: [ x: EqualToJson #{ expected: ExternalFormat #{ contentType: 'application/json'; data: '{"a":["a-x","b-x"]}'; }#; }# ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
